    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cea5f912dca4cfbc18c4a35a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后是空中救主……我看了她之前的比赛录像，\n最后冲刺的攻势远远在我之上。比拼末脚的话，赢不了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d7c90b1408cb503da361c80babe52adadfdf0475e678d7945df2fd23999cef6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
