      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就这样莱茵力量，向着『报知杯』\n每天坚持训练，最终――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d2383f7f3925b6a6947b3cf2106e4beedab4c6a90d17a73b2c60db17609a720",
