      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看来她进步了很多啊。\n看着这边的坚定眼神……有一种很强的气魄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "184830eba1578fd6bf24207f259974ff50af0e2ea6d00c96b0b26db78940a0b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
