    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d876c3ad8ce049bc8df1790",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "主持人",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ed44ed7a95b06e53444ad1a2cea67fb11356a9cc0cf6e05d4901cd3887226f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af9f18e95b349067104d1575",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天我们还邀请了＜斗宿六＞的担当训练员！\n训练员，你是怎样指导她们准备『樱花赏』的！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a58f16dc7a72e5c0203ffc79f4f5c0e17fac9b5b54a02125c77c42f3bbb8cf38",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:786201c15cd7bbd7825939c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一时间――我回答不上来。因为我，\n同时作为莱茵力量和西沙里奥的担当训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c46270ec7182aed1f1043afd0d08c5273462f154293ebe650ee0674807888c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a7d650fca0e3cb4a602a685",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了即将到来的『樱花赏』，我制定了训练计划。\n那是我应该完成的，重要的工作。但是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab55e0eb6689658d1ed0c0e4a73151aa4e31df979ac880df52e6192497876c87",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f3df221d50851d5c87d8abb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对于莱茵力量来说，\n那必须是最优先考虑『应对西沙里奥』的训练计划。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48eddb382a7da5e99a96ea0e1d1ed83ac1dc771004448849ec69392086b08623",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa9fd2bac53ff7add4e93127",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（这一对『矛盾』……我必须考虑到）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8f57ee155fef2f469d67428300e43f7d5d3e23948081e14eeaa37e3702697e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0201/storytimeline_020201071.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
