      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……当然，为了担当赛马娘的胜利，我会全力进行指导。\n不管是莱茵力量还是西沙里奥，两边我都会考虑……",
      "source_fingerprint": "559a33e04677783398f53623fe1386a997a0a7928abf8917bc9e4f5eda175ab0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
