      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不论谁获胜我都会高兴，而且我希望……两边都能赢。\n所以，我的方针是――平等对待2人，给予同等的指导。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88f52c9c366b6bdcc0e102aae503bcc7f75ff496f9077ac0a49ae62a101575a4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
